COMPILATION OF: E46J13

D: Disk Print
L: List Source Program
S: Symbol Table List

  SYMBOLS:

BLOCK AT LINE 1, AUTO STORAGE 0 BYTES
a 0000 E46J13 ENTRY PARAMETERS(0) EXTERNAL CONSTANT
BLOCK AT LINE 3, AUTO STORAGE 278 BYTES
c 0000 SYSIN FILE EXTERNAL STATIC
c 0000 SOURCEFILE FILE EXTERNAL STATIC
c 0000 PRINTFILE FILE EXTERNAL STATIC
c 0000 PAGESIZE FIXED BINARY(15,0) AUTOMATIC
c 0002 PAGEWIDTH FIXED BINARY(15,0) AUTOMATIC
c 0004 SPACES FIXED BINARY(15,0) AUTOMATIC
c 0006 LINENUMBER FIXED BINARY(15,0) AUTOMATIC
c 0008 LINE CHAR(14) VARYING AUTOMATIC
c 0017 BUFF CHAR(254) VARYING AUTOMATIC
   NO ERROR(S) IN PASS 1

   NO ERROR(S) IN PASS 2

PL/I-80 V1.4 COMPILATION OF: E46J13

   1 a 0000 E46J13:
   2 a 0006   procedure options(main);
   3 c 0006   declare
   4 c 0006     (sysin, sourcefile, printfile) file,
   5 c 0006     (pagesize, pagewidth, spaces, linenumber) fixed,
   6 c 0006     (line character(14), buff character(254)) varying;
   7 c 0006   open file(printfile) stream output title(line);
   8 c 0021   put list(line);
   9 a 0036 end E46J13;

CODE SIZE = 0039
DATA AREA = 0116
